         +------------+                         |
            front-ptr |                         | rear-ptr
                      V                         V
     +---+---+    +---+---+    +---+---+    +---+---+
     | * | *-+--->| * | *-+--->| * | *-+--->| * | / |
     +-|-+---+    +-|-+---+    +-|-+---+    +-|-+---+
       V            V            V            V
     +---+        +---+        +---+        +---+
     | a |        | b |        | c |        | d |
     +---+        +---+        +---+        +---+
@end example
@end ifinfo
